A story across groups

The group `Shop` holds `Cart` and `Checkout`. The group `Bank` holds `Gateway`.
Write the story `pay`: the `Cart` hands over to `Checkout`, and `Checkout`
charges the `Gateway`. Show it as a sequence.
---
Shop { Cart, Checkout }
Bank { Gateway }
story pay {
  Cart -> Checkout: hand over
  Checkout -> Gateway: charge
}
show sequence of pay
